AT WORK'. The design masterfully balances retro Swiss international typography with cinematic lifestyle photography. The overall aesthetic is characterized by a heavy, authentic analog film grain, tactile coarse paper texture, and a nostalgic, sun-bleached color palette dominated by warm cream, vibrant retro orange, and muted teal-blue. The layout presents a sophisticated technical grid with clean typography details, completely free of any third-party branding.", "A 4:3 format poster with a strict three-tier horizontal split composition layered with continuous heavy vintage paper grain. The upper half of the background is a solid, warm off-white cream paper texture with subtle analog dust and noise. Resting on the horizon line at the exact vertical center is the massive, ultra-bold, heavy condensed sans-serif word 'WORK' in a vibrant, slightly weathered retro orange hue. The lower half of the canvas seamlessly transitions into a calm, cinematic turquoise-blue ocean water landscape. Floating on the water is a realistic orange wooden fishing boat with a lone fisherman wearing a conical straw hat, holding a long thin fishing rod that casts a sharp reflection on the rippling sea surface. The entire image is cohesive, with fine technical magazine data text neatly printed in orange and white across the top grid and lower corners.", "art_style", "", "", "", "", "[\"#4F7942\",\"#87A96B\",\"#1A301A\",\"#F9F8F6\",\"#000000\"]", "", 25, ""], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "import_json", "label": "import_json", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "import_json"}, {"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "name": "height", "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}, {"widget": {"name": "high_level_description"}, "name": "high_level_description", "label": "high_level_descrip